---
---

<section class="about-section" id="about">
  <div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-intro">
        <div class="about-label">ABOUT ME</div>
        <h2 class="about-heading">
          你好，<br />我是马嘉蕾
        </h2>
        <p class="about-role">一名专注于品牌视觉的设计师</p>
      </div>

      <figure class="about-portrait mask-animation-trigger">
        <img src="/images/about-portrait.webp" alt="马嘉蕾" loading="lazy" class="about-portrait-image" />
        <div class="mask"></div>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="about-copy">
      <p data-reveal>
        拥有5年设计经验，兼具甲方品牌与乙方设计服务背景，熟悉品牌视觉体系建设、包装设计及线上线下商业视觉应用。
      </p>
      <p data-reveal data-reveal-delay="150">
        注重审美表达与品牌一致性，希望通过清晰、有辨识度的视觉语言，让品牌理念真正融入产品与用户体验。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="about-actions">
      <a href="#contact" class="about-connect">
        <span>Connect with Me</span>
        <svg
          width="14"
          height="14"
          viewBox="0 0 14 14"
          fill="none"
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="about-connect-arrow"
        >
          <path
            d="M3 11L11 3M11 3V9.5M11 3H4.5"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>

      <a
        href="/resume.pdf"
        class="about-connect about-resume"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener"
      >
        <span>Resume</span>
        <svg
          width="14"
          height="14"
          viewBox="0 0 14 14"
          fill="none"
          aria-hidden="true"
          class="about-connect-arrow"
        >
          <path
            d="M3 11L11 3M11 3V9.5M11 3H4.5"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="1.2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
